SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | piece_id           | castle
STATE        | kind                 | deskpal
STATE        | glyph                | 🏰
STATE        | instance_id          | CSTL
METHOD       | City                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" city'
METHOD       | Production           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" production'
METHOD       | Armed Forces         | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" armed_forces'
METHOD       | View                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" view'
METHOD       | Happy                | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" happy'
METHOD       | Rename               | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/ops/play_event.sh" "$0" "$1" rename'
METHOD       | Events (hq)          | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/events-hq/button.sh" "$0" "$1"'
METHOD       | Dir                  | sh -c 'exec xdg-open "$0"'
METHOD       | Close                | CLOSE
METHOD       | Cancel               | void
